      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TEGAN HAYZE (1) had the drop on the lead early on but could only manage third, beaten 2.5 lengths (30.12) at this track in a Restricted WIN over 510m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. One of the contenders. FEDERAL SAKI (2) flew the lids and led throughout to score a most impressive win by 6 lengths at this track over 407m (23.78). Has a good record here including three wins. The form out of last race has been strong. One of the prime contenders. ROY INTENTION (8) took the sit on the lead from a low draw but levelled up and led around the bend to score (23.78) at this track in a Grade 5 over 407m. The form out of last run is most impressive. In sparkling form with a string of wins and can measure up again. GOLDEN ART (3) is a last start winner and can go on with it.",
